        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The <strong>distributive law</strong> states that multiplying a group of terms by a number is the same as multiplying each term separately by that same number and adding the products.</p>",
            "readable_text": "The distributive law states that multiplying a group of terms by a number is the same as multiplying each term separately by that same number and adding the products.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>The distributive law works no matter how many terms are inside the parentheses. </p>",
            "readable_text": "The distributive law works no matter how many terms are inside the parentheses.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>For example, let&#x27;s take a look at the following expression:</p>",
            "readable_text": "For example, let's take a look at the following expression:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 4(a+2b+3)]</span> </p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 4(a+2b+3)]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We can expand this expression using the distributive law:</p>",
            "readable_text": "We can expand this expression using the distributive law:",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "graphic",
            "normalized_html": "<p><img src=\"/graphics/fcf29cd47a0f1a0aeed8f24d2601324a\"></p>",
            "readable_text": "[IMG: /graphics/fcf29cd47a0f1a0aeed8f24d2601324a]",
            "images": [
              {
                "src": "/graphics/fcf29cd47a0f1a0aeed8f24d2601324a",
