          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>For example, we can expand the expression <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 2(x+2y-3)]</span> as follows:</p>",
            "readable_text": "For example, we can expand the expression [MATH: 2(x+2y-3)] as follows:",
