            "readable_text": "[MATH: 2(x + 2y \u2212 3)|=; 2 \u22c5 x + 2 \u22c5 2y + 2 \u22c5 (\u2212 3)|=; (2x) + (4y) + (\u2212 6)|=; 2x + 4y \u2212 6]",
